                <zone fixed-size='100' forceUpdate='true' h='12222' id='542' type-v2='text' w='31028' x='442' y='26445'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333'>Using parameters, you can define the criteria for vendors you wish to delist from the platform. The table on the right shows a comparison between the original scenario and one without those vendors to estimate the impact. Click on &quot;Download List of Vendors to Delist&quot; to export the excluded vendors from the &quot;FILTERED&quot; column to Excel. </run>
